  "description": "## Fellow Crusaders!\n\nThis guild is banished, supporting trade-locked classes (banished, cursed).\n\nThis is a guild for fun only, there is no mandatory activity or mamdatory deposit required to guild. \n\n🚅 Daily Challanges will be generated regularly, so that it can be completed to give us enough Marks for building and for raids as well.\n\n💪Keep on with the great work, if you have leftover material, deposit it to the Stockpile (Bars 🪨 and Logs 🪵).\n\n#### Guild Foundations:\n- Accepting only any active Banished or Cursed player. \n- No level requirement (💪or 🍤 doesn&#039;t matter) \n- Stockpile donations are welcome (Logs 🪵 and Bars 🪨)\n- Challanges are refreshed on daily basis\n- Raids will be started on daily basis at 8PM 🕗(GMT+2), if we have the required Guild Marks from Daily Challanges, after the Guild Hall is built.\n- Guild Hall 🏰 will be upgraded using up Stockpile (donated 🪨 and 🪵) resources, at Citadel location.\n\n### News - 02/08/25\n- Raid.......................... ✅\n- Challanges............... ✅\n- New Applications..... ✅\n- Stockpiles................  ✅\n- Guild Hall.................. ✅\n\nRemind me if I forgot something 🚀\n\n#### Join our discord",
